    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-segment-register-question",
        "moduleId": "selection-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：硬件需要段寄存器回答两个问题",
        "markdown": "硬件在地址转换时通过段寄存器取得每个段的基址与界限，于是它必须先回答两件事：这次访问落在段内哪个偏移，以及这个地址到底引用了哪一个段。前者决定加多少偏移，后者决定使用哪一对基址/界限寄存器。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000200"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "我们引用哪个段"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3693,
              "lineEnd": 3724,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/ebebc4c954700034f3ebb561e44180e5c8e1efb0557c5df12c1f780b69b7bd11.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/427075188ef337113202f0d62e77d2323fec4d1fd7e638aefa629f50fcaff874.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "2a555e8f9184a962573400aeacfd3784cee1f3efa05a6124871cc1bac367e788"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-need-segment-id",
        "moduleId": "selection-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "把一次转换拆成两级选择",
        "markdown": "可以把地址转换拆成两级：先用段号选出「用哪一对基址/界限」，再用偏移在该段内定位。若跳过第一级，直接给整个地址加上某个基址，就会用错段的基址与界限，得到的物理地址自然不对。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-segment-register-question"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-explicit-top-bits",
        "moduleId": "explicit-bit-encoding",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：显式方式用虚拟地址开头几位标识段",
        "markdown": "一种常见方式称为**显式（explicit）方式**：用虚拟地址的开头几位标识不同的段，VAX/VMS 系统使用了这种技术。教材的例子中有代码、堆、栈 3 个段，因此需要 2 位来标识。设虚拟地址共 14 位，则高 2 位是段号，其余 12 位是段内偏移。若前两位为 `00`，硬件判定这是代码段，使用代码段的基址和界限重定位；若前两位为 `01`，则是堆地址，改用堆的基址和界限。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000200"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "我们引用哪个段"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3693,
              "lineEnd": 3724,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/ebebc4c954700034f3ebb561e44180e5c8e1efb0557c5df12c1f780b69b7bd11.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/427075188ef337113202f0d62e77d2323fec4d1fd7e638aefa629f50fcaff874.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "2a555e8f9184a962573400aeacfd3784cee1f3efa05a6124871cc1bac367e788"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-bit-layout",
        "moduleId": "explicit-bit-encoding",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "补充：14 位地址的字段划分",
        "markdown": "把教材的 14 位例子整理成字段表，便于对照后面的掩码：\n\n| 字段 | 位宽 | 位置 | 作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 段号 | 2 位 | 高 2 位（bit 13–12） | 选出使用哪一对段基址/界限 |\n| 段内偏移 | 12 位 | 低 12 位（bit 11–0） | 与基址相加，并用于界限检查 |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-explicit-top-bits"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-4200-binary-decode",
        "moduleId": "explicit-bit-encoding",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材：虚拟地址 4200 的解码过程",
        "markdown": "以堆中虚拟地址 4200 为例，它的二进制形式为 `01 0000 0110 1000`。前两位 `01` 告诉硬件这是堆地址；剩余 12 位 `0000 0110 1000` 即十六进制 `0x068`，也就是十进制 104，是段内偏移。硬件用前两位决定使用哪个段寄存器，再把偏移与基址相加得到物理地址。偏移还简化了段边界判断：只要检查偏移是否小于界限，大于界限的即为非法地址。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000200"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "我们引用哪个段"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3693,
              "lineEnd": 3724,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/ebebc4c954700034f3ebb561e44180e5c8e1efb0557c5df12c1f780b69b7bd11.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/427075188ef337113202f0d62e77d2323fec4d1fd7e638aefa629f50fcaff874.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "2a555e8f9184a962573400aeacfd3784cee1f3efa05a6124871cc1bac367e788"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-worked-verification",
        "moduleId": "explicit-bit-encoding",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "补充：把 4200 的转换算完整",
        "markdown": "按教材例子走一遍：$4200 = 0x1068 = 01\\,0000\\,0110\\,1000_2$。高 2 位 `01` 判为堆段，低 12 位 `0x068 = 104` 是偏移；物理地址 = 堆段基址 + 104，界限检查只需验证 104 小于堆段的界限。注意整个 4200 不能直接加到基址上，否则会把段号位也算进偏移。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-4200-binary-decode",
            "tb-explicit-top-bits"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-pseudocode-masks",
        "moduleId": "explicit-bit-encoding",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：段选择的伪代码与掩码常量",
        "markdown": "教材把这段硬件逻辑写成如下过程：\n\n```txt\n// get top 2 bits of 14-bit VA\nSegment = (VirtualAddress & SEG_MASK) >> SEG_SHIFT\n// now get offset\nOffset = VirtualAddress & OFFSET_MASK\nif (Offset >= Bounds[Segment])\n    RaiseException(PROTECTION_FAULT)\nelse\n    PhysAddr = Base[Segment] + Offset\n    Register = AccessMemory(PhysAddr)\n```\n\n在 14 位地址的例子中，`SEG_MASK` 为 `0x3000`，`SEG_SHIFT` 为 12，`OFFSET_MASK` 为 `0xFFF`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000200"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "我们引用哪个段"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3693,
              "lineEnd": 3724,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/ebebc4c954700034f3ebb561e44180e5c8e1efb0557c5df12c1f780b69b7bd11.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/427075188ef337113202f0d62e77d2323fec4d1fd7e638aefa629f50fcaff874.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "2a555e8f9184a962573400aeacfd3784cee1f3efa05a6124871cc1bac367e788"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-mask-relation",
        "moduleId": "explicit-bit-encoding",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：掩码常量如何对应字段宽度",
        "markdown": "三个常量正好对应字段宽度：14 位地址本身可用 `0x3FFF` 覆盖；`SEG_MASK = 0x3000` 只保留高 2 位，右移 `SEG_SHIFT = 12` 位后得到段号；`OFFSET_MASK = 0xFFF` 只保留低 12 位，得到偏移。界限比较针对的是偏移而不是整个虚拟地址，因此段在虚拟地址空间中的起点不会被误计入。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-pseudocode-masks",
            "tb-explicit-top-bits"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-wasted-encoding-and-implicit",
        "moduleId": "implicit-and-tradeoffs",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "教材：编码浪费与隐式判定",
        "markdown": "两位段号本可以表示 4 种取值，而例子中只有 3 个段，因此有一个段的地址空间被浪费。有些系统因此把堆和栈当作同一个段，只需要 1 位来做标识。硬件还有其他方法决定地址属于哪个段：在**隐式（implicit）方式**中，硬件通过地址的产生方式判断段——由程序计数器产生的地址（指令获取）在代码段，基于栈指针或基址指针的地址一定在栈段，其他地址则在堆段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
